{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-47a8-b9c0-123456789abc",
    "name": "iPhone Rental API - Sistem Penyewaan iPhone",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman RESTful API untuk Sistem Penyewaan iPhone (iPhone Rental System).\n\nFitur Utama:\n1. Autentikasi Admin & Manajemen Profil (JWT)\n2. Katalog Publik (Tanpa Token)\n3. Dashboard & Statistik KPI\n4. Manajemen Model & Katalog iPhone (CRUD)\n5. Manajemen Inventaris Fisik Unit iPhone (CRUD & Status)\n6. Transaksi Booking Atomik via WhatsApp (Prisma Transaction, Double-booking Prevention, Auto-status Update)\n7. Upload Gambar (Bukti Transfer & Foto Unit)\n8. Laporan Transaksi & Ekspor CSV\n\nCara Penggunaan:\n1. Jalankan request '1. Login Admin' pada folder '2. Autentikasi'.\n2. Script Test akan secara otomatis menyimpan token ke variable `token`.\n3. Request lainnya yang memerlukan otorisasi (Admin) akan otomatis menggunakan Bearer Token tersebut.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "slug",
      "value": "iphone-15-pro-max-256gb",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "modelId",
      "value": "2c1dbd1a-dfa1-49b1-a28f-686c6c502aab",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "unitId",
      "value": "aa6179b4-4fcb-49cb-b623-3db365db43b1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bookingId",
      "value": "6f8da2c1-9dd0-45ad-a742-10db6812f1b5",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
